cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the paper below and the source corpora."
title: "IoMT-SecAlarmBench: A Semi-Synthetic Counterfactual Benchmark for Integrity Attacks in IoMT"
abstract: >-
  A semi-synthetic benchmark that injects controlled integrity attacks into
  authentic coupled ECG+PPG ICU recordings from PhysioNet/CinC 2015 under a
  factorial design and three attacker capability levels, retaining the clean
  waveform of every attacked window for signal-level and alarm-level
  counterfactual evaluation.
